{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30006_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0f8f542a29785f2bf6bee26c38c7e6c3926379fb1a85e8bc32146b33d5c59c80",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0644f88cf4f46438c05018495f5ebf9dc43f19163d9d59bec3066eb0e6ee13bd",
      "text": "幕后花絮的幕后",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf74a1eee4b4ab0d1c293ae29a6c2dd36d29fecaf74aeafb6d971886c887765",
      "text": "315 Pro的视频频道决定开启一项新企划。\n次郎、北斗、薰、享介、\n雨彦5人被选为了首期成员。\n于是成员们决定拍摄新歌MV的幕后花絮，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0644f88cf4f46438c05018495f5ebf9dc43f19163d9d59bec3066eb0e6ee13bd",
      "text": "幕后花絮的幕后",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a3a607d0c2767425decfacf146dd295ab3a45cf070fd1f4a70bc126d32f526",
      "text": "正在观看315 Production频道的各位！\n大家好。我是苍井享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c3d121bc619335555bae4805f85858535ad22e40b53ce7d4982b174498b9d1a",
      "text": "我是伊集院北斗。Ciao☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5957432b8b35cc2876b3f8043b9298315e3a577fa87bf9d93f2697615319e5f",
      "text": "我是樱庭薰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:253227cbff2573648d91ac8150cbda3b27e449656f0a89f115c0176d4e0c5fdb",
      "text": "大家好～\n我是山下次郎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3e8364c5e4ad9a7b0e4a9e1c5af5afb0135165bada16a9bf1c3d2e94bd056d",
      "text": "我是葛之叶雨彦。\n请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdeeda6fcf8b35e18e4d179e185ea8d6853c84ee24ad514febce35a22e0d824b",
      "text": "是不是觉得这阵容很罕见？\n其实，这个频道要开启全新的企划啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c548d15ab0d60c009bff0cfe1c0e567775aa1fe05fd4be5279824006e6094da4",
      "text": "每次都会发布打乱组合重新搭配的视频哦。\n说不定还能看到罕见的组合呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d552a596441ad0ed1f201ef5056eb7ecbed9fb734f19a9b3722e87ce13abe9d1",
      "text": "而且……居然！我们有幸被选为了\n第一批出镜的成员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0837cf9859981e6cf32a27eafe22e0a32976127d63ee9b644394388e35f7c068",
      "text": "之后要公开的最新歌曲MV拍摄现场也会展示一点点，\n请大家一直期待到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46702b0acd609d3154c494befb76e0a6d373eabfde62c54d1fa516144d97d8e2",
      "text": "那么，VTR开始☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "几个月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfb8523fa13166f0740262e27625b9f38850ab556c18cc98ed2e7afb193106b",
      "text": "视频频道里要做什么，这就定下来了。\n剩下的就是回应粉丝们的期待了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dee8df32b90e33dc33681ebeba37c0ea2acdc45c8267bfefe77757d3793063f3",
      "text": "辛苦大家啦。哎呀～能定下来太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfcfaf7e993f61d38b5388156c6f38d27e5aa019f7a32e558e29e4fffd58b721",
      "text": "之后就拜托你啦，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c5a2077136b4c0d8270694ca764b01beb31ee2fd11ddba7653edb103c5d0373",
      "text": "好的。日程调整和拍摄许可申请\n就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00eaff3cb2d2345e8d28ab977cc416ab40ac04edadb3375385f7aab0e9c5079e",
      "text": "再次向各位确认一下，拍摄地点定在服装间\n和MV拍摄时的摄影棚可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2e63ec0c89fb8227852110e654587bf3981ba820d17a0f2eaa9ea1b3ea267e9",
      "text": "嗯，那样就可以了。\n拜托你了哦，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e3d28ce5892e284622f1e02ba8b8350c099fad0ca9374d3545e5e48abb5828",
      "text": "啊，不仅是舞台本身，拍摄布景的幕后花絮\n要是也能拍进去的话，可能会很有趣呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de7e463335493b04afe52faf4becf954ae8ca5d8cc1547de5d0a1986e80485f7",
      "text": "嚯，好主意。我觉得试一试也\n未尝不可，大家觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:164a13621ea6fcb2c3cf3880690a6ceee01aa1757977632d618690082bc2f642",
      "text": "说的也是。某份问卷调查里确实有人提过\n想看后台花絮。把那个也加进去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:121bd701242d929c63711bd8087b17b78567dad2123b4e0a9804da178b60a625",
      "text": "填了问卷的天使酱们\n一定会很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f9a9ff31b52607a1c994781c18217f01ed2c5c5342bd50de8e442870ec3ae9",
      "text": "难得有这个机会。能做的事情就全部做一遍，\n漂亮地办妥吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96a12d01948ff910a87be09c67ffe4b929d6baa618f51e00c7b23e4e49794c93",
      "text": "我也会加油的。\n次郎老师也要一起加油哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_b:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2683a18b0c078c27711c897f849a250982c2435cbb81ef5728c52d09831d334",
      "text": "遵命遵命。\n大叔我会努力的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e177dfbf193080aacbb38a961fa02f955c4ecbdda4bfd8e863afec74ef96ba77",
      "text": "哈欠……\n今天的练习时间好早啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6c14fc6466ec7bdaeca6e559bab103cb9e8f4cc5d67cd629c3ae05087f9caf",
      "text": "啊哈哈，次郎老师打了个大哈欠呢。\n大家要是看到这个，应该会很高兴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962053f2584785b241f48cf21aa47d972357556a6c8d8f949b390f8464fdcd97",
      "text": "哎，不会吧。摄像机已经在拍了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9621640cad433701ab9894621d4b7e2914d540ee5ce34372a1be9b21506c49f1",
      "text": "啊哈哈，开玩笑的啦！\n给，雨彦先生。相机还给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac62fb4992a22ba6c738808392247ed13ef826a880ef289fccb8a6d9a00246c",
      "text": "嗯。今天的摄影师是我。\n请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:401ca3276699895c31e5e739b76d119f699caf5a719ab6e2a8a9da0e3e63a18a",
      "text": "没多少时间闲玩了。\n快点开始拍摄吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000095:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2287e17dac5d2e783996ac58232f3ea6c9d6df1b2c254da262e34adffacacc48",
      "text": "视频拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bcbb1c5a6fb36f493f6e098bb1297155b2694d947c7a50ae73388134c5cf3be",
      "text": "正在看这个视频频道的各位。\n我是负责掌镜的葛之叶雨彦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2d48fb29d04e48984ba66397a90e39e5d6a328b78d109620f8c0fe92b3a00c2",
      "text": "我们目前正在为了MV拍摄进行排练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ec9a5660adcf8b8976aa4493bb412e36482629051536e38034bf0215b4ee5d",
      "text": "天使酱、天使君。\nCiao☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b4d5813095bcf06b0d06dfd2f0735de3b3e83e4a9b492128f065447aba40a4e",
      "text": "现在正在做跳舞前的热身。\n……这位，能先暂停一下拍摄吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_c:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad469e298f39bd28fd3610ed3d6d045fa313968b90ae9067e38cbb4bdf6d6283",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3b89273bfc6da3111ba60c1d4e6f96a037c40ffb49524edacc97b1e0967ba33",
      "text": "哎，有点问题。因为个子太高，拍出来的效果\n似乎不如预想的那么好。虽然我也调整过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2def8d4f4c1b2f7a6d69fb78f1bca82885c7363113ec3f7761ea7d882d56f24",
      "text": "像个头较矮的苍井弟弟，都被截出画面了。\n算了……让你直接看一眼更快吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d6bb36f6db21e97c026f9d0a490fc7008fa9cd0d8d013c8860409856769d08",
      "text": "让我看看……\n啊，真的耶！我只露出了个脑袋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27b22ace0fd415174ca9475df09fb1840bfcce58e2ef3dd3e301245cdc77ddc3",
      "text": "这样可不行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:788054ab0fb3a739d00b8e11422b9aed780f3c0c3d6983adae312129293f22fb",
      "text": "我可能不太适合当摄影师。\n找人替一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1960a19776c851e4bf8d45c8016cb647cd4f43885d9ebcdc80a5d8843a849493",
      "text": "那就由我来负责掌镜吧。\n毕竟粉丝们也一定想看到所有人的脸庞。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771a5144fa8caf467c190d76595538fb753e54eac56ec9625d9e7386a55937b2",
      "text": "也是。\n拜托你啦，这位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000090:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a91143ac681e6ffc389e7719ebbf31fba89060631b0918657d121456761381ef",
      "text": "呼……稍微休息一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00b19cefde85e017e791782e13aa30565bb6a9950e7348761f38a9888a38c31",
      "text": "这次的新歌，北斗君觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0106829adf7a94ecbdeafa0243c5fdd944f7efff1c5ece1df40359475b0b29d4",
      "text": "很时髦很棒呢。\n想早点在演出中展现给大家看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4120483361af960acaa3cfdfcc2a14d54247fb8cd9b51efa3c2c668f379e2730",
      "text": "对表演水准的要求也很高。\n必须通过反复练习达到完美才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0ec33789eaf074d4eedac9b35cb3ef5b42920968a424b808e5bcaa09a98bd98",
      "text": "说的也是呢。\n也是为了让天使酱们感到高兴☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4114609bfbda665a2d75c2944f860d0e0e17087c1ef4ce92412b0930524fc2a",
      "text": "那么接下来我们还要去多加练\n一会儿哦！先拜拜～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c65bfa976b43a0d4a61186a68c9902f09a2e52efed8aef0cf2dfd6b9bd7a49c",
      "text": "这就是今天拍的视频呢。\n我们赶紧一起确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00b19cefde85e017e791782e13aa30565bb6a9950e7348761f38a9888a38c31",
      "text": "这次的新歌，北斗君觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45b875d91c1dc851295dacd2bd7f17f5e6a45a089d124b7c244475a7b20a5467",
      "text": "啊，感觉不错。\n拍得很清楚呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:318067d21560c645da28f50f710b5d977158063637b9b35967fc6f4c43d58465",
      "text": "嗯。换成●●●●プロデューサー来当\n摄影师果然是正确的选择。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0106829adf7a94ecbdeafa0243c5fdd944f7efff1c5ece1df40359475b0b29d4",
      "text": "很时髦很棒呢。\n想早点在演出中展现给大家看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0436404b9b25c7bed4b0be59240935c36eaf16ed43b0f2f3149723cc5334150",
      "text": "伊集院真是不一般啊。\n在这种地方也能给粉丝送福利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef02d2d38fca09feaa92d6e3790de413309c3f7dc1491e5a1081a7b55df5b6cc",
      "text": "是啊。这种态度真值得学习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a4ae45b2d8d6d779769c278a4ad643884576f42fa28968f9858bee86b113a96",
      "text": "哎呀，樱庭先生。\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fc07830a86871ce5433d0cec1b284726508d237e1885da7b5f1886070f84dc4",
      "text": "……不，没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab281584865bc9aba351fc4bdf2414ac17b138e42563180403b7ba91ff262034",
      "text": "……这样啊。\n如果有什么事请尽管说哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000190:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c251d79b82b12f2c4608e7a037de3a5f374bebc3f83e159901168b9d24365f81",
      "text": "……喂。\n我是樱庭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000200:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f65f7a1faa1537d3d59ab303ade93ea93f6dc747effd329b275403632c6f84",
      "text": "关于视频的拍摄有些事想商量，\n所以给你打了电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000202:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:489a9fe961a4e7d6e6440e85aa6a559b6c4e9e069238c7dfca8e80d1c69c2f1a",
      "text": "请问是什么事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000205:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50d96909a7dd864be9a87dc6e390107557173db6cc7c859f82980dc33e48e38d",
      "text": "拍出来的视频视角和背景几乎\n没有什么变化，这让我有些在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9b1c049f1d91126dbee39ba8bc305a019e65db9ec9a8409b5029d09727b2d6f",
      "text": "说话的人离得很远，也有让人搞不清楚\n到底是谁在说话的缺点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55ee8f80afdedd5bc821aee3779e5c77b6436fd71648adef235d8cedc376b2ab",
      "text": "虽然只是细节，但只要在呈现方式上下功夫，\n整体的质量也会提升上去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000211:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:026c6797df79e18e42a252f5a3ebd9750cb8b633fc62d0297217885da9e729eb",
      "text": "我们是打头阵的。\n不能拿出半吊子的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000213:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd7ce515bc4f688980abcb59bd47f17153fb031d83713f9510c24f63a396e189",
      "text": "正因如此，我想就这一点安排一个共享意见的\n机会。能拜托你吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000215:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "我明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000216:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8783e70766efcb600d304a269d147d794fe42612847889922ccb54e0e2abc56",
      "text": "我会转达给\n大家的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_e:cmd-000219:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:522005ca88eccb9101453cc1837482a338d1cc37de5e9452aeb0e60952dadff6",
      "text": "那么，向成员转达的事就拜托你了。\n事情就是这样。麻烦你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f17f27d79bc76e10259a8056eb4e560f31f336182157bfe237f161d19e318456",
      "text": "今天把大家召集起来，正如之前所转达的，\n是因为录制视频有些让人在意的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d9aa6f0d6dcff5bc3214adac8ef2b766b98d6b6be980c18a099b555d5f5bf8",
      "text": "录制视频是指昨天的排练视频吗？\n我觉得拍得很清楚啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46c647b425b9cc1925fdb22e6093df3d81d4a55efe78081b58d79abb20537da3",
      "text": "嗯。画质确实无可挑剔。\n但这次的问题不在那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1b0a039e7a6a9ccc2c6a77007763653b94db63b085b9562c2c1b73796b4f44",
      "text": "首先，画面的视角长时间保持不变。\n这样的话跟固定在三脚架上毫无区别。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2406f098befcfcc1a7443aee9b4543407ce2ae460a68af115a83a0aba51a2851",
      "text": "还有一点。成员距离镜头太远了。\n多拍拍我们的面部，粉丝不是会更高兴吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d7c2258d5a181dfc85c1caa7c90223052935cfba7a1fa91382ce295ca3cf286",
      "text": "啊……确实可能是那样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79cb157217b10e161d47d9c03fe076fa6379053f39051cff5d1c23f5ee8ae3dd",
      "text": "原来如此。\n那一点我之前倒没怎么在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140201b69a88d6123e47fbc6450a3ee0002c537b58add281b3758eacd581609d",
      "text": "虽然用现有的素材也能凑合做出像样的视频，\n但我们必须追求更高的水准。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5ad1c0d9305b08a4c6c64f382e99517636591c9edaf51002a431f20e12614ee",
      "text": "之后请注意这一点继续推进吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7b8ae88dfb7086bd74efc38ec76cdccd91615b6b499d8f0f7b61815911a37f5",
      "text": "樱庭老师，谢谢你啦。\n这样一来感觉能做出更好的作品了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c104972d9d7d4db5b298954fe34d765e78057381eb5495c3c6f5b4947cc92592",
      "text": "嗯。\n今天的拍摄也继续加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62cd88fe0f027d65383d654baefe435c4cdf9420b69ab4cfca11b11d64170f72",
      "text": "服装间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04008a50e73a20cd75f6bb6539d21daeabc2bf5b01b0892d90484647b593ec9e",
      "text": "天使酱们，Ciao☆\n今天我们来试穿MV里要穿的服装哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f11de86acdd50cf7f746933c4196e2c0b0791e91321299a465f87fff289e0b0",
      "text": "哇，这里的全部都是演出服？\n好庞大的数量啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42fa9345dd1db1286edf9e517a95f46e04126218724b4300b40ca3571d91782",
      "text": "嗯，真壮观。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6c191ad630c3aec0fb71ec34b17616cc9c6094fc6b67f212ecbe4ca9eac62f",
      "text": "现在葛之叶先生正在试衣中。\n在他换好衣服之前，我们先逛逛服装间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4067db0c198c92c2c6143def6fdf74761cb4a2a661d25e7dcc8d83d4e6686f46",
      "text": "哎呀～有好多厉害的服装呢。\n大叔我眼睛都快晃花了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebdce6e5de27e343aaba4c065c56d7dca8dc1b88682681929d3d939ddf2e0754",
      "text": "我们的服装在哪里呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5087298bedaaf81d9fca13b6074957134f038e7a0f0a1151cba3e8bb09357e5d",
      "text": "我记得因为日程安排的关系，薰先生\n提前试穿过了对吧？感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b275ec193e642676e6542d31b082fe6b4ace7d8d6e6a1d5a5bfbeaa1dbe7986",
      "text": "专业的评价我说不上来，但那是与歌曲氛围\n十分契合的优质服装。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4b863f8212b92bccccf0f40a0accd4fd6f904929df55a228445727ab1f8e9a2",
      "text": "粉丝们应该也会喜欢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38263efc0f684185635d157ae2cb710cfb2a5fd6880f02e3f6c2257e4706235e",
      "text": "这样啊。\n我也好想快点穿上试试看啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd2403b48039a4e8f9f91cb25ed0b59c3ecc251a74966d82de4967c53547ee2f",
      "text": "……哎呀，葛之叶先生好像换完\n衣服了。赶紧让我们一饱眼福吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e012cc7d648f16110d5cdc175acfc637eb08c4a53e54ecd8fbaafa2d5deca05",
      "text": "……好。试衣完毕了。\n怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:572fa3b6c9cae825cd8c98e0e2d35513b0af38d8afe24265341294ad236b2a01",
      "text": "真不愧是葛之叶啊。\n身材比例好，穿起来很有型呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38f08d0f592759b0032a0144d3b716d9529b10bf7b2c36768b12478e5abe49c6",
      "text": "大叔我，能不能穿得\n这么帅气呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42b73d0f867fcfe7ea72a9ea73adf17ae932db86f09be879e25a15c87e455d0",
      "text": "这么说的山下先生，身材也很棒吧。\n反正到了正式上场肯定能帅气驾驭，真是让人不可小觑呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcbbcd7104d511da205d3adcdb0e437596b5c3331a1df285d2f1ec590d00ba5f",
      "text": "啊哈哈……要是那样就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c12093b4655264b33300eb61ac9c94bb56d359a9cbb1ad6b2f134ef8e5970c",
      "text": "葛之叶先生。请对着镜头前的天使酱们，\n说上一两句吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6310b6081570260e95c0d23b451c701ddef983be3c099411583808ba554b2916",
      "text": "……好，我知道了。\n稍微靠近一点镜头可能更好一些吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2ad1b946a9f7c3e781e84a9829a32a7479d97459068161eddbb821187f41582",
      "text": "服装大致就是这种感觉。怎么样，还不赖吧。\n至于背后……就敬请期待MV的公开吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b7fabf6af34c0d62b68459cb0e59ef407d1db9d4e88fdf1772b803e1e0ef0c",
      "text": "我们也去换衣服啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b2ad0fd186b7e43f55d9203669a9b48ee7a134ad7fb779d2616f2da29ac3f11",
      "text": "其他人的服装造型马上就来。\n请大家继续欣赏下去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000126:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000139:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f57d92cf04f92a7f9be9853cf9f6122be1ee1e50e2a78aa0bcadb98305e633",
      "text": "辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000141:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24769d8880f4a1df9628113f7f071547cc9bfb79b58a678936ac72840b853eef",
      "text": "废话不多说……\n请大家说说看了试衣视频的\n感想吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000143:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0249fe13cfc1de635923d56fab64744b8dd4d7fed1bbcbb7b4aed0ffe05dd7c9",
      "text": "比起最开始拍的那个，\n我觉得变好很多了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef9a646dbc88d187e03fac1287a25e2b4845a803605cf78c2829d7e278366b4",
      "text": "是啊。\n一下子变好了很多呢。\n多亏了樱庭先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000147:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5956b20ab6c3350618258e1e5fd92e2a1e644ced463071b822f913e7a91dd5e",
      "text": "理所应当。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000149:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5eaec45efa12beb9d45437eee4bb626acc161fb71d93da685656bc9dcc5ba7f7",
      "text": "特别是葛之叶先生\n面向粉丝送福利的那段，\n我想大家一定很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000151:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d59cb26760739796926f8b2be9deed6c2f7045931fdbc6ba1c446a504074412",
      "text": "是吗？\n多谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000153:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39a175a193dae56ddc56088fc3dfadf30157b36a9025791f3f8d160c26bd2e50",
      "text": "好期待看到剪辑好的\n成品呢。\n监督也是这么想的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000155:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000155:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:937b500d12f4c01b052692b6c1e8847ca09b828dcdd729b99ca0fbe00854e700",
      "text": "是的！\n下了一番工夫真是有所收获呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000158:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaf228f48431c50c0ab9fca75434f6a2f5d625f6fe4af53180e358cd9009f511",
      "text": "保持这个势头迎接\n下一次拍摄吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_h:cmd-000160:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fe47ebdf1b7f023a448f0486847db41d1978380714265c7b9d0dfc656c280c7",
      "text": "嗯。\n今后也要继续加油呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea47e4a5d66a43b99ca41ee498b739720575ae0d469c5638c342dafe2f6d806",
      "text": "……那么，舞台参观大家看得开心吗？\n接下来就是MV拍摄了……所以我们换好了服装哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6e7ed6875a933584957cd7a7b7e6d3d1f1b4481816091034eb9c499d7ebc545",
      "text": "放在视频里看应该只是一眨眼的时间吧。\n……山下老师好像回来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90f807d19793ad9badde79cd96ee14ee4dd8264c38d7a99d12e9d49c786d1ca5",
      "text": "我回来啦～。服装怎么样？\n大叔我穿这个会不会显得格格不入？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ded87844a1cc006f94f1f0fe9550e7a584d4209182a5dc6c42ee36a5152668c8",
      "text": "不会，非常合适哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eec45df56866a94128591101eeb63b9443d2c6d80dadaabc170ddae7a128beb",
      "text": "啊哈哈，谢谢。\n被伊集院夸赞总觉得有些不好意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82f18bcb824c8f07d578271694475d84695db24f6a05d96e227e58ed0b3503ae",
      "text": "会拍成怎样的MV呢～\n现在就已经超级期待了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fe1008634e2744641d2d1930a853477c9425e390e2f1ee2c9fb7cbcace7be11",
      "text": "毫无疑问会成为优秀的作品。\n为此我们至今付出了很多排练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31d4df2c9320bfe41b5e1a82e015605f6f14684749ff9906033885a4b415ec17",
      "text": "樱庭先生真是自信满满啊。\n不过，我们也是同样的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cf42d630ab7b6c244d9aa1f1afc4ff508931a4e7468355cc99b5a73d6e6a3b3",
      "text": "哎呀，差不多要开始拍摄了呢。\n那么享介君，能拜托你做结束致辞吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a46665fce9edd08e005ff8f430a0a7c9421e8484e64580289f95edbf63a5c8f2",
      "text": "好！……这个视频频道，\n今后也预定会继续发布视频哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_i:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a73e5f5d7f40062cb757bca0a461f42d17c6cd826c1b741c19c18f9b9aa6cb8",
      "text": "那么各位，拜拜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c548d15ab0d60c009bff0cfe1c0e567775aa1fe05fd4be5279824006e6094da4",
      "text": "每次都会发布打乱组合重新搭配的视频哦。\n说不定还能看到罕见的组合呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d552a596441ad0ed1f201ef5056eb7ecbed9fb734f19a9b3722e87ce13abe9d1",
      "text": "而且……居然！我们有幸被选为了\n第一批出镜的成员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0837cf9859981e6cf32a27eafe22e0a32976127d63ee9b644394388e35f7c068",
      "text": "之后要公开的最新歌曲MV拍摄现场也会展示一点点，\n请大家一直期待到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46702b0acd609d3154c494befb76e0a6d373eabfde62c54d1fa516144d97d8e2",
      "text": "那么，VTR开始☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000247:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3b79d6144128354fbcd8dfdb0e1997ddff9a43180e80051070a3567bfeee3b6",
      "text": "加上剪辑之后，就变成这样了啊。\n成了一段很棒的视频呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000260:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:178eb46e048707b64cfe3cd8fc4652de1a83abc80d6d8dd1e9a7d5ae03731186",
      "text": "这样的话粉丝们应该也能看得开心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000265:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:563042b671a54719823912d4992efedc5cca9bfff6e0763e107cc2f1ffbd1378",
      "text": "这一番努力真没白费呢。\n樱庭老师也辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000273:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfe2a9714f9b572cc817f60067de4c27d0a36a1a97eb7e50d365c8f4530c7be",
      "text": "既然要做就要全力以赴。\n这是理所当然的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000302:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c896ec9da453e7327b6cae57dbdec86ca064362f642d5482b79d3427886f880d",
      "text": "多亏了各位，\n才有了精彩的视频和MV呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_j:cmd-000308:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d34a7903736d70f1be4d81e2b82b34cf8c0c73ae1c9ba3c509c1b4d2a1dcef3",
      "text": "是啊。\n就好好期待粉丝们的反响吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d2cd74274c60ed65a3c5ea9a6b49ac68af270d3a4f8ee80e5fd42dd8ef5e92",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，Ciao☆\n哎呀，大家都到齐了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f743b8e8c5f4dd3532248c3e91ab94a87147e926b3fd90691bf02bcf619dc8fa",
      "text": "辛苦啦，伊集院。\n我们也刚到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b4934d95b2d1a4bc769a4606eff7e9b7ad262b7862e69509398ee8dfc2717ec",
      "text": "大家看粉丝们的反应了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b82cf67574b9f851c9d8697eee78ef79a693d60b79cc6437695b568e5cb87676",
      "text": "嗯，当然看过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d9825ad1bf5abdc606e70a7e1d9069fbf80f8787551921a9b4fbb39c23531d9",
      "text": "视频下方的评论区里\n粉丝们的反响非常热烈。交出了满意的答卷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0fa1aa2547aa7c0c9b3bde3994c6760fc878c838d64e32365eff359aeeeccaa",
      "text": "对下一个视频抱有期待的声音也很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1765ceaf51cb47c60c1b4c41b7bc005cc47c7992fa7d1e900da60e6dae3b71a8",
      "text": "感觉我们顺利完成了使命呢。\n太好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54772456e25750c2bd9f0d1a2e28576fb6e7d020e053ee40760828c2f64ae27b",
      "text": "下一批成员也让人期待呢。\n不知道会是怎样的视频呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec2b3603cb64d5c96e2299dd26417ad28aec33baddd2bc369c9a2e4ef8631f68",
      "text": "大家都辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_k:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
